@prefix autofde: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/autofde/ontology#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


# Work, process, and projection semantics
#################################################################

autofde:PhaseGraph a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:Phase a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:WorkItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:WorkDependency a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:ConcurrencyRelation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:ExclusiveChoiceRelation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:SupersessionRelation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:PreservationRelation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:ProcessCommitment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:POWLProjection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:ProcessCommitment .
autofde:ProjectGraphProjection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:GitHubProjection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:ProjectGraphProjection .
autofde:ProvisioningGraph a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:ProvisioningDependency a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:TerraformProjection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:ProvisioningGraph .
autofde:SemanticEquivalenceClaim a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:Repository a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Milestone a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Issue a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:WorkItem .
autofde:Label a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:PullRequest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:WorkItem .
autofde:Release a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .

autofde:WorkDependency owl:disjointWith autofde:ProvisioningDependency .

#################################################################
